# Through the Quicksand Caves: the exits. Entered at area 1, Shimmering_Circle plays 32003: option 0 stays,
# option 4 leaves the fight (0x075). Entered at area 2, the next Shimmering_Circle (by id +1) plays 32003
# and option 4 leaves. After the first exit the next tick still adds the battlefield effect (254) and
# moves the char into the arena; the warp back removes it.
lists ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/SC_Entrance/onTrade ChamberOfOracles/onEventUpdate/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32000 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32001 ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/32002 ChamberOfOracles/Shimmering_Circle/onTrigger
char zone=ChamberOfOracles pos=-218.6,-1.9,23.0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart ThroughTheQuicksandCaves current
login
trigger SC_Entrance
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger Shimmering_Circle
finish option=0                         # stays
trigger Shimmering_Circle
finish option=4                         # out
tick 2000
warp -218.6,-1.9,23.0 ChamberOfOracles
trigger SC_Entrance
update 32000 option=2
finish
trigger Shimmering_Circle+1             # area 2's: 32003
finish option=4                         # out
